rooms_desc ({"The entrance hall of the house of Sytar.On the northern and western wall are windows, and youcan see a beautiful garden when you look through them. On the northeasterncorner is a rake for your shoes and your cloak.You notice that to the east is the Hungarian part of the house, and to thesouth is the English part of the house. To the north is the Treasury, butyou can't enter.","A bejarati eloter utan a Magyar resz eloszobajaba jutsz. A bejarati ajtonkivul ket ajton juthatsz tovabb a haz belsejebe. A szoba egyszeruen, decelszeruen butorozott, egy kis telefonallvany, tukor, eloszobaasztal, esegy Munkacsy kep teszi teljesse a berendezest.","This is a brand new, unfurnished room.  As soon as you see it, youstart imagining interesting ways to decorate it.. it could be anything,a cupboard, a conservatory, an orchard, heaven or hell..A small note in the corner says:  'help build/furnish'."," Ez a szoba a pihenoszoba. Egy szep, nagy tagas szobaban allsz,a szemben levo fal egy uvegfal, egy gyonyoru viragoskertre nyilik.A resnyire nyitott ajton at a viragok bodito illata szivarog be a szobaba. Az illat ellazit es relaxal, pihenni vagy az edeni kornyezetben.A masik fal mellett egy jokora franciaagy talalhato alvas [vagy nem alvas :) ]celjabol. A masik fal mellett egy talalo all, mellette egy barszekreny,csakis a legjobb italokkal. A szoba sarkaban egy viragallvany van, korbe rajta futok szinesitik a szobat. Az agy folott a falon Csontvary\"Maria kutja\" cimu festmenye log, vele szemben pedig a \"Zarandokok a maganyos cedrusnal\" cimu alkotasa.A szoba teteje kup alaku, es szinten uvegbol keszult, a kilatas az egrepedig oly pazar, hogy elall tole egy percre a lelegzeted.","A helysegbe belepve egy olyan furdoszobaban talalod magad melyet eddigcsak elkepzelni tudtal. A padlo tukor boritasu, de talpad megsem fazik,mert a helyseg alolrol futott. A szoba elipszis alaku, az ajto aharmadik negyedben van, belepve toled kisse jobbra azz elso negyedbena kadat latod, mely a szobahoz igazodva szinten elipszis alaku, a masodik negyedet a kagylo es a piperepolc foglalja el, mig veled szemben a torulkozok kaptak helyet. A szoba szelenel gyenge legaramlatoterzel, ami a szellozoberrendezes holleterol arulkodik.Ahogy korulnezel furcsa erzes fog el, a szoba falai tukorrel boritottak,igy barmerre nezel onmagadat latod kisse eltolodva, kulonbozo oldalakrol.Megzavarodva a helyseg hatasatol feltekintesz es pillantasod a mennyezetreesik, mely szinten tukorrel boritott, es domboritott is. Ezuttal megfurcsabban erzed magad, ugyanis onmagad egy ujabb tukorsorban pillantodmeg, de teljesen szokatlan nezetbol felulrol es alulrol. A szoba kozepenmegpillantasz egy enyhen vilagosabb tukorcsempet, es mikor raalsz mar csak hat peldanyban latod magad. Furcsa erzes fog el, es eltunodsz, valoban itt lenne a vilag kozepenek helye, es Te allsz most ott?","A Kincstar. Altalaban egy rahedli hasznos holmival van tele.","This is a brand new, unfurnished room.  As soon as you see it, youstart imagining interesting ways to decorate it.. it could be anything,a cupboard, a conservatory, an orchard, heaven or hell..A small note in the corner says:  'help build/furnish'.","This is a brand new, unfurnished room.  As soon as you see it, youstart imagining interesting ways to decorate it.. it could be anything,a cupboard, a conservatory, an orchard, heaven or hell..A small note in the corner says:  'help build/furnish'.","This is a brand new, unfurnished room.  As soon as you see it, youstart imagining interesting ways to decorate it.. it could be anything,a cupboard, a conservatory, an orchard, heaven or hell..A small note in the corner says:  'help build/furnish'."," This is the room of the flowers. All over the room near the wall you cansee hanging pots with different flowers, only common in them isthat everyone from them is very beautiful. On the middle of the room is a table, around it six chairs, and in the middle of it it's a big crystal vase, with 20 lovely roses on it, everyonefrom them with a bit different colour like the others. There is a very pleasant here, the room smells like a beautiful garden.",})
